# the engine's second page of knobs (TP_X1..X4): EDIT's second page where the engine has one (rayon, acid: Sub), and
# on knit its Levels page, fourth after Osc 2 and Mod: osc 2's level, the sub, the noise, the volume; osc 2's interval is on
# Osc 2 (tests/scenarios/editpages.xy has every engine's pages). The screen reader says them; another engine, or
# another track, takes the page away
wait 300
spin ALGO 2
expect trk 3
knob 3 engine jacquard
tap EDIT
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
expect par3.oct 2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# knit: osc 2 in unison and off
knob 3 engine knit
expect par3.engine 0
expect par3.x1 64
expect par3.x2 0
listen
turn SELECT 3
expect page Levels
wait 400
said Levels
shot sub_off.png
# the interval, on Osc 2: the screen reader says it
turn SELECT -2
expect page Osc_2
spin K1 7
expect par3.x1 71
wait 400
said interval +7 st
spin K1 -40
expect par3.x1 40
spin K1 60
expect par3.x1 88
spin K1 -17
expect par3.x1 71
turn SELECT 2
expect page Levels
spin K1 50
expect par3.x2 50
spin K2 40
expect par3.x3 40
spin K3 20
expect par3.x4 20
wait 40
shot sub_layers.png
# the list: the Levels page's knobs among EDIT's
tap SEL
wait 40
shot sub_list.png
tap HOME
# a note with the layers on
key 7 down
wait 200
expect voices 1
key 7 up
wait 300
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT -1
expect page Levels
# another track (jacquard: no Levels page): back to the button's first page
spin ALGO 1
expect trk 4
expect page Engine
spin ALGO -1
expect trk 3
turn SELECT 3
expect page Levels
# another engine on the Levels page (jacquard): back to Engine, three pages
knob 3 engine jacquard
expect page Engine
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play_2
turn SELECT 1
expect page Engine
# rayon: Sub second, its fall, floor, keyscale
knob 3 engine rayon
turn SELECT 1
expect page Sub
wait 400
said Sub, page 2 of 4
spin K1 30
expect par3.x1 30
turn SELECT 1
expect page Play
